+- **Enterprise security and request lifetime**:
+  `ResourceQuickViewService` coalesces matching in-flight projections and invalidates
+  the active generation on context changes; it does not retain a completed-record
+  LRU cache. Every fresh open resolves the current item surface. The hover trigger
+  waits 280 ms by default; explicit activation starts immediately. Discovery reads
+  the resource catalog, the item and its contextual surfaces before resolving the
+  filtered response schema and projection. A pending HTTP request can therefore
+  outlive dismissal even though its obsolete result cannot update that popover.
